#: ../../docs/jobs/slurm-web.rst:4 3865baffd2724fa7af5e1a8a7d19639d
msgid "系统页面提交"
msgstr "System web submission"

#: ../../docs/jobs/slurm-web.rst:8 df1f0ed1cda749d293748f42b58dbf2c
msgid ""
"本页面介绍的是旧版 web 提交作业的界面，已不再使用。新版平台 通过交互式应用卡片（Jupyter Lab / Terminal / vscode "
"等）启动 任务，相关介绍请参考 :doc:`applications`。本文件保留以供 历史参考。"
msgstr ""
"This page describes the legacy web job submission UI, which is no longer "
"used. The current platform launches tasks via interactive application cards "
"(Jupyter Lab / Terminal / vscode, etc.); see :doc:`applications`. This file "
"is kept for historical reference."

#: ../../docs/jobs/slurm-web.rst:13 2a6352d563ca4bbf850a23c457630cdd
msgid "系统支持直接在页面提交作业。"
msgstr "System support direct submission of jobs on the page."

#: ../../docs/jobs/slurm-web.rst:15 eca3da9b356245b2a167918f0dcdd35f
msgid "点击上方“集群”按钮，选择“提交作业”。"
msgstr "Click the \"cluster\" button above and select \"submit job\"."

#: ../../docs/jobs/slurm-web.rst:17 93da479fed554db49064fcd4169cec3e
msgid "|submit job web|"
msgstr "|submit job web|"

