#: ../../docs/jobs/slurm-web.rst:27 a0b222d8fb604542ac1602b04fa0331f
msgid "提交作业后，可以在“作业”页面查看是否提交成功。"
msgstr ""
"After submitting the job, you can check whether it is submitted successfully"
" on the \"job\" page"

