#: ../../docs/jobs/slurm-web.rst:33 a938f7a4166b4951b60ffd8de8289b76
msgid "如果提交的作业有输出，需要下载，等待作业运行完成后，点击作业名称，进入作业详情。"
msgstr ""
"If the submitted job has output, you need to download it. After waiting for "
"the job to run, click the job name to enter the job details."

